WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.698
Structured intelligence can name platforms, software, and vulnerabilities, while deployment choices remain open.

00:08.698 --> 00:15.843
AutoSUT separates source evidence, deterministic routing, and committed environment choices.

00:15.843 --> 00:24.016
Two surrogate SUTs satisfy the same measured constraints. The same procedure executes 10 and 1 of ten steps.

00:24.016 --> 00:31.993
The reviewer package links each claim to the source, routing rule, chosen profile, and preserved outcome.
